      "text": "#LAGOS-IBADAN EXPRESSWAY. #MOWE-IBAFO \n#TrafficUpdate\n\n*Section: IBD-LAG (Inbound Lagos):*\n\n1.A Brighter weather with good traffic ambient on the axis from the Interchange to Conoil, Danco and Berger yard this time.\n\n2.Eldorado to Lufuwape,\nCatholic and Danliti turn (New-Makun Axis) is good and motorable this moment.\n\n3.Christopher University to Youth camp, RCCG main gate and Carpark C: good movement.\n\n4.Mowe junction to Lotto, Olowotedo, Nasfat turn and Aseese: good movement on the stretch.\n\n5.Oremeji to Ara Hall & Ibafo market and Mountain Top university (MTU): good to traverse.\n\n6.MFM to Magboro:is equally experiencing good movement.\n\n *Section: LAG-IBD (Outbound Lagos):*\n\n1.The return journey from Lagos to Magboro, MFM, Ibafo and Ara hall is experiencing good movement.\n\n2.Aseese to Nasfat, Deeperlife and Lotto: good movement.\n\n3.Mowe to Car park C RCCG Main gate, Youth camp good movement ,\n Christopher University: good movement.\n\n4.Danliti to New Makun, Lenuwa, Eldorado is good. \n\n5.Danco to NNPC and Sagamu interchange: better movement.\n\nVirtually, all the landmarks within the corridor are in good shape this time",
